# Riverglades - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 5 confirmed flagged rares of Riverglades and
# its one lootable fixed container. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not
# up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever
# game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE dropper
# is the rare. All five rares work multi-point patrols, so every rare step is
# a loop (a loop needs at least two points). No tame lines ship (the data has
# no tameability flag and the core guide carries no tame corroboration - see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere,
# so none are stated. No rare in this guide is a giver, ender, or objective
# of any core-contracted quest - see docs/riverglades-companions-inventory.md.
guide butler-routes-completionist/riverglades-rares
title Riverglades - Rares & Treasures
levels 36-45
zone Riverglades
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords riverglades, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Kargra the Blind — the west-center

  zone map 2548

  loop
  goto 26.70,47.70
  goto 26.85,47.02
  goto 27.14,48.36
  goto 27.22,41.32
  goto 27.87,47.61
  goto 27.93,47.07
  goto 30.23,48.59
  kill 256892 optional
  collect 281666 "Robes of the Blind Cultist" optional
  note Level 46 rare working its 7 confirmed points in the west-center - one above the guide band; its sole drop is the Robes of the Blind Cultist. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

