  collect 271613 "Head of Scaldaron" optional
  collect 281650 "Dragonscale Buckler" optional
  note Level 43 rare elite working its 14 confirmed points on the far west coast; the twin Heads of Scaldaron are its sole drops alongside the Dragonscale Buckler. The 271612 head is the objective of Hail the Dragonslayer - contracted in the core guide, which owns the accept and turn-in; the 271613 head is the same-title Horde twin's version, not yours. The buckler has no quest taking it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Rock Piles — the east-center

  zone map 2548

  loop
  goto 65.20,25.00
  goto 66.40,25.50
  goto 67.10,29.00
  goto 68.40,29.20
  goto 74.80,39.60
  interact 649094 optional
  note Rock Piles sit at five fixed points in the east-center; they hold Good Rock and Bad Rock. No quest takes either - this is the zone's only lootable fixed container, said plainly as one.
  note Respawn timers unconfirmed.

